Here's the problem file for putting a plate in the microwave:

```pddl
(define (problem put_plate_in_microwave)
  (:domain robot1)
  (:objects
    robot1 - robot
    Plate - object
    Microwave - object
    counterTop - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot1 counterTop)
    (at-location Plate counterTop)
    (at-location Microwave counterTop)
    (not (inaction robot1))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location Plate Microwave)
    )
  )
)
